#version 460
// Dense PS5Q4 matvec with x staged in LDS once per workgroup (4 waves), each wave streaming rows
// r = wg*rpw + wave, + 4, + 8, ... : x traffic per row drops by rpw while keeping 4 waves per WG.
// For large K (6144: 24 KB of x) where per-wave register staging thrashes the cache (S13 profile).
#define BITS 4
#include "common.glsl"
#ifndef KDIM
#define KDIM 6144
#endif
layout(local_size_x = 256) in;
layout(push_constant) uniform PC { uint64_t w; uint64_t x; uint64_t y; uint K; uint N; uint rpw; uint mode; float alpha; } pc;
shared vec4 xs[KDIM / 4];
const uint QW = (KDIM / 32u) * QWPB;
void main() {
    const uint lane = gl_SubgroupInvocationID, wave = gl_SubgroupID;
    V4 X = V4(pc.x);
    for (uint i = gl_LocalInvocationID.x; i < KDIM / 4u; i += 256u) xs[i] = X.v[i];
    barrier();
    const uint SW = scale_words(KDIM), RW = row_words(KDIM);
    U32 W = U32(pc.w);
    F32 Y = F32(pc.y);
    const uint r0 = gl_WorkGroupID.x * pc.rpw;
    for (uint rr = wave; rr < pc.rpw; rr += gl_NumSubgroups) {
        const uint r = r0 + rr;
        if (r >= pc.N) break;
        const uint rb = r * RW;
        float acc = 0.0;
        for (uint w = lane; w < QW; w += 64u) {
            const uint b = w >> 2, j = w & 3u;
            const vec4 lo = xs[b * 8u + j], hi = xs[b * 8u + 4u + j];
            const uint q = W.v[rb + SW + w];
            float s = qval(q, 0u) * lo.x + qval(q, 1u) * lo.y + qval(q, 2u) * lo.z + qval(q, 3u) * lo.w
                    + qval(q, 4u) * hi.x + qval(q, 5u) * hi.y + qval(q, 6u) * hi.z + qval(q, 7u) * hi.w;
            const float sx = lo.x + lo.y + lo.z + lo.w + hi.x + hi.y + hi.z + hi.w;
            acc += block_scale(W, rb, w) * (s - ZERO * sx);
        }
        acc = subgroupAdd(acc) * pc.alpha;
        if (lane == 0u) {
            float o = acc;
            if (pc.mode == 2u) o = acc / (1.0 + exp(-acc));
            else if (pc.mode == 3u) o = 1.0 / (1.0 + exp(-acc));
            if (pc.mode == 1u) Y.v[r] += o; else Y.v[r] = o;
        }
    }
}
